# Every pull request in this repo requests a review from the maintainers team.
#
# Without this file GitHub requests nobody. The org ruleset on `main` requires
# one approving review, but it sets `required_reviewers: []` and
# `require_code_owner_review: false`, so a pull request opens with no reviewer
# and generates no notification. Automated pull requests are the ones that go
# unnoticed, because no human is watching for them.
#
# The team needs write access or better for GitHub to honour this. The
# `maintainers` team has `maintain` on this repo.

* @kairos-io/maintainers
